00:10:55.115 --> 00:11:02.875
But they we do have some limitations on when we can cut things and stuff like that. So we'll have to work around both those things that are identified.

00:11:03.355 --> 00:11:06.315
Again, it's not any big deal. We expected,

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:10.720
