00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:40.760
sixteen.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.600
There's a difference of about $17,000

00:12:45.175 --> 00:12:47.415
We have all the money to pay it,

00:12:48.295 --> 00:12:59.895
but the problem is that if we just pay it without the company agreeing to it, the state won't sign off on it and the federal government won't reimburse us the 80%

00:12:59.895 --> 00:13:00.535
of

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:01.470
the

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.150
difference.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.310
So the bottom line is,

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:10.510
from the town's perspective, this turns out to be about a $3,000

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.310
difference,

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:20.005
whether the discrepancy is agreed to or not, because we're only on the hook for 20% of the cost of the discrepancy anyway,

00:13:20.405 --> 00:13:24.805
but it's really annoying that it's been holding up the project for quite some time.

00:13:25.205 --> 00:13:26.965
I'm semi hopeful

00:13:27.205 --> 00:13:33.420
that in the next three to four months, we're actually going to close this thing out, but no guarantees.

